{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1263874-halloween-events","id":1263874,"title":"Halloween Events?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-10-31T13:59:51-07:00","id":1263874,"title":"Halloween Events?","content":"What are the various supernaturals up to during Halloween? Surprisingly, I couldn't find that many references to it in the books I have. Even Geist doesn't mention it, although I find it hard to believe that Sin-Eaters don't at least put on some Wakes to celebrate. Are there any canon references to rites or celebrations put on at this time of year for various splats?<br /> <br /> And are there any you have in your headcanon? It seems likely to me that the Circle of the Crone does something, and maybe the Ordo Dracul and the Lancea Sanctum as well; among the vampire clans, I can see the Mekhet really doing it up, along with the Daeva and maybe even the Nosferatu. <br /> <br /> Any others?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-31T16:37:16-07:00","id":1263927,"title":"","content":"it would be a night where you don't need the Blush for one thing,<br /> <br /> Prommies can't really do Halloween. Since even if it's expected their Disfigurments will still cause Disquiet.<br /> <br /> The Ashwood Abby would throw some kind of event, will be crazy<br /> <br /> Also Demon's would be able to attend parties with their Demon forms, if they use Context Matters so that is fun","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><s